# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0029.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Document Upload -> Document Parser
Document Parser -> Text Chunker
Text Chunker -> Embedding
Embedding -> Vector Store - docs
User Query -> Query Condenser
Query Condenser -> Preflight Analyzer
Preflight Analyzer -> Plan Generator
Plan Generator -> DurableAgent
DurableAgent -> Vector Store - queries

Ingestion Pipeline { Document Upload, Document Parser, Text Chunker, Embedding, Vector Store - docs }
Query Pipeline { User Query, Query Condenser, Preflight Analyzer, Plan Generator, DurableAgent, Vector Store - queries }
